sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant API as API / alert reconciler
    participant DB as PostgreSQL jobs
    participant Worker as Durable worker
    participant Workflow as Incident workflow
    participant UI as Console / Slack

    API->>DB: Insert pending tenant-scoped job
    Worker->>DB: Claim with owner and lease expiry
    Worker->>Worker: Renew heartbeat lease
    Worker->>Workflow: Execute investigation or remediation
    alt completed
        Workflow-->>Worker: Persisted result
        Worker->>DB: Mark completed
    else retriable failure
        Worker->>DB: Release for bounded retry
    else attempts exhausted
        Worker->>DB: Mark dead_letter
    else cancellation requested
        Worker->>DB: Mark cancelled
    end
    DB-->>UI: Status and timeline available through API
